| `project_name` | string | `my_project` | ASCII letters, digits, spaces, underscores or hyphens; starts and ends with an ASCII letter or digit | copier's validator, before deriving `project_slug` and `project_title` | Renames the project in its docs and, through `project_slug`, in `config/project.json` `name`. | the distribution name in `pyproject.toml`, which uses `project_slug` | always |
